      "message": "fix(ci): cache the existing large applicability source files\n\nRaise only the parser cache eligibility limit from 262144 to 524288\ncharacters so the two observed heavily reused Rust files are eligible.\nKeep each independent 128-entry LRU, current-content key, original path\nand read checks, immutable results and full parsing above the limit.\n\nC3 actually timed out again at the unchanged 300-second gate after\nnineteen cases. Retain that failure. This internal retention change does\nnot increase original CI resources or deadlines and claims no gate pass.",
